# Notable incident-analysis project safeguards

Apply only in `llm_notable_analysis`. Read current root `AGENTS.md` and use
the local `notable-incident-workflow` skill. Current `docs/case-analysis-contract.md`
and `docs/incident-response-ui-parity.md` define behavior across the four native
products. Preserve retrieval-bound read-only chat, retired automatic-query
boundaries and existing action gates. Documentation and local verification do
not authorize response execution or deployment.

Keep future-work/review backlogs local and untracked. Shared reasoning fixes use
the global `llm-evidence-regression` principle across affected native products;
preserve local contracts and intentional product differences. Follow current
global Terraform policy for new/changed cloud infrastructure, not legacy alternate
templates. Existing resources require an explicitly scoped migration.

Preserve the on-prem-only presentation pilot and its exact reviewed source/hash
exceptions; it does not authorize cloud rollout. Never import a sibling checkout
at build or runtime to manufacture parity.
